---
import '../styles/home-guests.css';
---
<section class="ah-guests ah-section" id="guests" aria-labelledby="guests-heading">
  <div class="ah-section-heading"><h2 id="guests-heading" tabindex="-1">嘉宾阵容</h2><label class="ah-guest-photo-switch"><span>照片轮播</span><input type="checkbox" data-guest-photo-rotation aria-label="自动展示嘉宾照片" /><span class="ah-switch-track" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></div>
  <ul class="ah-guest-grid" data-public-guests hidden></ul>
  <div class="ah-guests-empty" data-public-guests-empty><span class="ah-guests-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h3>嘉宾阵容，陆续公布。</h3><p>与组织者、游戏创作者和青年创作团队，一起交换想法。</p><a href="#speaker-recruitment" class="ah-text-action">带来你的分享 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</section>
